/// | `swap(x)`                     | `next == x && ret == prev`                                                                                                 |
/// | `compare_exchange(x, y)`      | `prev == x && next == y && ret == Ok(prev)` ("success") OR<br> `prev != x && next == prev && ret == Err(prev)` ("failure") |

